  "action_permissions": "Movement targets must be old-empty ground or a complete positive-health bridge cell; common empty targets go to lowest agent id. Construction reaches own/cardinal-adjacent cells and needs the missing material. Giving requires positive stock and an old adjacent peer. Repair needs both resources and a reachable completed cell below maximum integrity. Delivery requires an undelivered parcel at an opposing terminal. Old live bridges govern movement; newly built cells become available next transition. A zero-health occupied cell keeps its occupant, allows waiting/repair/valid exit and rejects new entry. Joint terminal allows only wait; invalid actions become wait.",
